#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/cli.md:40
#: cb51c94b6f3e48faa254ed4beff32b97
msgid "Using GWpy CLI"
msgstr "GWpy CLI の使用"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/cli.md:42
#: c47bc60a726945d7b64bfc83e8629d5c
msgid ""
"If you need GWpy's command-line tools, refer to the [GWpy "
"Documentation](https://gwpy.github.io/docs/stable/cli/) directly. GWexpy "
"does not currently provide a documented compatibility layer that forwards "
"the full GWpy CLI surface."
msgstr ""
"GWpy のコマンドラインツールを利用したい場合は、[GWpy "
"ドキュメント](https://gwpy.github.io/docs/stable/cli/)を直接参照してください。GWexpy は現在、GWpy "
"CLI 全体を透過的に転送する互換レイヤを文書化していません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/cli.md:44
#: 340bc4cfe18e4c2b8b73bfee6f5b19ef
msgid ""
"**Note:** For complex analysis pipelines, gravitational wave parameter "
"estimation, and custom data processing, the **Python API** is recommended. "
"See the [Getting Started](../tutorials/getting_started.md) guide for API "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** 複雑な解析パイプライン、重力波パラメータ推定、独自のデータ処理には **Python API** を推奨します。API の例は "
"[はじめに](../tutorials/getting_started.md) ガイドを参照してください。"

